      "cooked": "<p>It says Vengeance tie in right on the cover.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-277-writers-room-mind-over-matter-53\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-277-writers-room-mind-over-matter-53\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1a6627793cbae4ecf7bc1ded6dbf80eff1ff26ff.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-277-writers-room-mind-over-matter-53\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #277 - Writers' Room: Mind Over Matter #53</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We're going to a darker time!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:37:29 We're right at it, and telling a story that gets pretty Dark... Dark Visionary, that is! I'd say \"spoilers\", but you could have already seen the cover by this point, so there you go. And it...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f92ace28e249a58c4e38685fee0183caee716ff5.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/f92ace28e249a58c4e38685fee0183caee716ff5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f92ace28e249a58c4e38685fee0183caee716ff5_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zyeBcMfxSR8eHIZyezUARl4kXw9\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f92ace28e249a58c4e38685fee0183caee716ff5_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f92ace28e249a58c4e38685fee0183caee716ff5_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f92ace28e249a58c4e38685fee0183caee716ff5_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f92ace28e249a58c4e38685fee0183caee716ff5_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1320×2047 335 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
