      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"30724\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I love this idea to make Baron Blade take his ball and go home. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> And now I really want to see Baron Blade versus another villain!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Reminds me of that Disparation with the alternate F5 where Argent Adept joined instead of Tachyon, and they were more magic and magic-tech based.</p>\n<p>Maybe a Disparation/What-If story where some villain manages to kill both Legacy and Tachyon, and Felicia goes to Ivan with a “Look, you and my dad had… stuff. But you’re the only one who can do this.” Maybe takes the name Luminary, maybe goes by some variant of Tachyon (I think a different particle would be more appropriate… but Positron is already taken in a different IP). I could also see his response being “Fine… but you are NOT Legacy” and she takes a different superhero name, too.</p>",
